 letter-spacing: -0.7vw; }}","@media (max-width: 768px) {p {font-size: 4.5vw; line-height: 6vw; }}"],"settings":{"video":"shopify:\/\/files\/videos\/fullerene-c60.min.mp4","video_url":"https:\/\/www.youtube.com\/watch?v=_9VUPq3SxOc","description":"","content_width":"small","content_position":"md:items-center md:justify-center","text_alignment":"center","video_url_mobile":"","content_position_mobile":"items-end justify-start","text_alignment_mobile":"center","color_text":"#ffffff","color_highlight":"","gradient_highlight":"","color_button_text":"#171717","color_button_background":"#ffffff","color_button_gradient":"","color_overlay":"#171717","overlay_opacity":60,"enable_parallax":true}},"multicolumn_ym6DgV":{"type":"multicolumn","blocks":{"column_ea4FJK":{"type":"column","settings":{"show_border":false,"text_alignment":"left","text_alignment_mobile":"left","image_ratio":"adapt","heading":"Improve Cognitive Abilities","heading_size":"text-2xl lg:text-3xl","text":"<p>Wearing Hyperlight Optics optimizes the functioning of biomolecules in the brain, resulting in improved mental state and heightened productivity and efficiency. It enhances attention, focus, and memory, facilitating improved decision-making and enabling peak mental performance even under stress. With Hyperlight Optics, you boost productivity and efficiency.<\/p>","button_label":"","button_link":"","button_external":false,"button_icon":true,"highlighted_text":"none","highlighted_scribble":"circle"}},"column_XKbqr6":{"type":"column","settings":{"show_border":false,"text_alignment":"left","text_alignment_mobile":"left","image_ratio":"adapt","heading":"Optimize Your Vision","heading_size":"text-2xl lg:text-3xl","text":"<p>Hyperlight Optics® helps protect your eyes from both natural and artificial light. Our indoor and outdoor solutions are designed to support sharper vision, enhanced visual clarity, and reduced eye strain throughout the day. Experience richer colors, greater visual comfort, and less discomfort during screen time. Our lenses help reduce glare from bright lights while providing clear, balanced vision and all-day comfort in changing light conditions.<\/p>","button_label":"","button_link":"","button_external":false,"button_icon":true,"highlighted_text":"none","highlighted_scribble":"circle"}},"column_6mxUKB":{"type":"column","settings":{"show_border":false,"text_alignment":"left","text_alignment_mobile":"left","image_ratio":"adapt","heading":"Supports Natural Hormonal Levels","heading_size":"text-2xl lg:text-3xl","text":"<p>Studies show daily wear of Hyperlight Optics optimizes levels of serotonin (happiness hormone), dopamine (pleasure hormone), melatonin (sleep regulation hormone), and cortisol (stress hormone), resulting in physiological balance restoration. Benefits include improved mood, better focus, improved sleep quality, jet lag relief, increased energy.<\/p>","button_label":"","button_link":"","button_external":false,"button_icon":true,"highlighted_text":"none","highlighted_scribble":"circle"}},"column_gWWcCW":{"type":"column","settings":{"show_border":false,"text_alignment":"left","text_alignment_mobile":"left","image_ratio":"adapt","heading":"Anti-Aging Benefits","heading_size":"text-2xl lg:text-3xl","text":"<p>Hyperlight Optics® provides anti-aging benefits by safeguarding the delicate skin around your eyes. Our technology transforms harmful light into a skin-friendly hyperlight that aids in collagen and elastin synthesis. This process helps guard against new wrinkle formation and supports natural skin vitality and youthfulness.<\/p>","button_label":"","button_link":"","button_external":false,"button_icon":true,"highlighted_text":"none","highlighted_scribble":"circle"}}},"block_order":["column_ea4FJK","column_XKbqr6","column_6mxUKB","column_gWWcCW"],"custom_css":[".multicolumn-card__info {display: flex !important; flex-direction: column !important;}",".heading {height: 2rem !important; margin-bottom: 2rem !important; align-items: flex-start !imp