 better vision, clearer thinking and greater overall well-being. Its scientific inspiration comes from fullerene C60, a unique carbon molecule also found in stardust. C60 is one of the most perfectly symmetric structures known to science: 60 carbon atoms arranged in 12 pentagons and 20 hexagons. The discovery of fullerene C60 was recognized with the Nobel Prize in Chemistry in 1996. This gave the world a new understanding of carbon geometry, symmetry and nanomaterials — and opened new directions for scientific research. Zepter took this discovery further through Hyperlight Optics®️. With its proprietary ZC60-X light-structuring component, Hyperlight Optics®️ transforms ordinary light into a more ordered, harmonized and biologically resonant form of light. That is why Hyperlight Optics®️ is not ordinary eyewear. It is a new relationship with light — created to protect the eyes, support the brain and help the body maintain its natural order.","heading_size":"title-sm","heading_alignment":"text-left","heading_tag":"h2","button_label":"","button_link":"","button_external":false,"button_icon":true,"color_text":"","color_button_text":"#000000","color_button_background":"#ffffff","color_button_gradient":""}},"reveal_image_with_text_BdkME3":{"type":"reveal-image-with-text","custom_css":[".banner__box {margin: 40px 0; padding: 0 40px; max-width: 100%; width: 100%; position: absolute; top: 0; left: 0; right: 0;}",".banner__box h2 {margin: 0; padding: 0;}",".text-opacity {opacity: 0 !important;}","@media screen and (max-width: 767px) {.banner__box {margin: 20px 0; padding: 0 20px; } .banner__box .heading {font-size: 6vw; line-height: 7vw; }}"],"settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/DividerD.png","image_mobile":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Divider2_824f102c-513f-4859-8435-169810b9b293.png","content_width":"medium","heading":"Discover the serenity of zero gravity with Hyperlight Optics. Our innovative design and technology mimic the tranquil weightlessness of space, providin